<section class="fragment-instrument" data-artifact="instrument" data-slice="data-schemas-generator">
  <table class="in-signals">
    <thead><tr><th>Signal</th><th>Kind</th><th>Where</th><th>Note</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>content.loaded</td><td><span class="in-kind in-kind-event">event</span></td><td>crates/engine/src/data/mod.rs:load_json</td><td>One line per content file: kind, relative path, schema_version, item count, 12-hex file hash.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>content.refused</td><td><span class="in-kind in-kind-log">log</span></td><td>crates/engine/src/data/mod.rs:load_json</td><td>One error line per refused file: kind, relative path, field path, reason; the same text is the error message.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>content.hash</td><td><span class="in-kind in-kind-gauge">gauge</span></td><td>crates/engine/src/data/mod.rs:Content::hash</td><td>12 hex characters over attributes, tuning, rules, team A, team B; carried in match-stats and run-report.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>match-stats.teams</td><td><span class="in-kind in-kind-event">event</span></td><td>crates/engine-cli/src/simulate.rs:end</td><td>teams: [{team.id, team.name}] for sides A and B; additive to the engine-core keys.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>generator.league</td><td><span class="in-kind in-kind-event">event</span></td><td>crates/engine/src/data/generator.rs:generate_league</td><td>seed, clubs, players, attribute mean, min, max, and the content.hash used.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>identity.owner_created</td><td><span class="in-kind in-kind-event">event</span></td><td>crates/engine/src/observe/identity.rs:load_or_create</td><td>Marks the first creation of owner.id; the value rides only in records.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>tickfile.header</td><td><span class="in-kind in-kind-event">event</span></td><td>crates/engine/src/record.rs:write_header</td><td>Extended: schema.version 2 adds owner.id and the match.id stamp.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <div class="in-dark">
    <aside class="callout callout-warn"><div class="callout-hd">Dark path · silent refusal</div><div class="callout-body">A refused content file exits 1 with one stderr line and no record. Covered by content.refused with kind, path, field, and reason.</div></aside>
    <aside class="callout callout-warn"><div class="callout-hd">Dark path · unknown content</div><div class="callout-body">A match on edited content looks identical to one on the shipped defaults. Covered by content.hash in match-stats and run-report.</div></aside>
    <aside class="callout callout-warn"><div class="callout-hd">Dark path · generator drift</div><div class="callout-body">A generator outside the tuning bounds still produces valid-looking squads. Covered by generator.league mean, min, and max; the calibration slice checks the bands.</div></aside>
    <aside class="callout callout-warn"><div class="callout-hd">Dark path · owner regenerated</div><div class="callout-body">A deleted owner.id is recreated and later records carry a new owner. Covered by identity.owner_created.</div></aside>
  </div>
  <style>
    .fragment-instrument .in-signals { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .fragment-instrument .in-signals th, .fragment-instrument .in-signals td { text-align: left; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(127,127,127,0.25); vertical-align: top; }
    .fragment-instrument .in-kind { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.7rem; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid currentColor; }
    .fragment-instrument .in-kind-event { opacity: 0.95; }
    .fragment-instrument .in-kind-gauge { opacity: 0.8; }
    .fragment-instrument .in-kind-log { opacity: 0.7; }
    .fragment-instrument .in-kind-trace { opacity: 0.6; }
    .fragment-instrument .in-dark { display: grid; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px; }
    @media (max-width: 480px) { .fragment-instrument .in-signals th:nth-child(3), .fragment-instrument .in-signals td:nth-child(3) { display: none; } }
  </style>
  <script>
    (function () {
      var root = document.currentScript.closest('.fragment-instrument');
      var signals = root ? root.querySelectorAll('.in-signals tbody tr').length : 0;
      var dark = root ? root.querySelectorAll('.in-dark .callout').length : 0;
      window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('sdlc:fragment-ready', { detail: { name: 'instrument', artifact: 'instrument', counts: { signals: signals, darkPaths: dark, pii: 0 } } }));
    })();
  </script>
</section>
